    "In the Immich web UI, open Account Settings > API Keys and create a new key with asset.read, asset.view, person.read and album.read. To copy or drag out originals, also add asset.download (without it, the large preview is used). The key is kept in the keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Immich 網頁的「帳號設定 > API 金鑰」建立新金鑰，權限勾選 asset.read、asset.view、person.read 和 album.read。想拷貝或拖出原始檔，再加 asset.download（沒有就用大預覽圖）。金鑰存在鑰匙圈裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Info (⌘I)": {
