            "value": "伺服器在 3 分鐘內沒有回應"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server’s trash is turned off, so they are deleted for good.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "伺服器的垃圾桶已關閉，所以會永久刪除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They go to the server’s trash, which keeps them for 30 days unless the server is set otherwise. ⌘Z puts them back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "照片會移到伺服器的垃圾桶，除非伺服器另有設定，否則保留 30 天。按 ⌘Z 可以復原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This can’t be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此動作無法還原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the first photo’s date. All %lld photos move by the same amount.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這是第一張照片的日期。%lld 張照片都會移動相同的時間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
